+
+Status: in progress. Read `CLAUDE.md`, `lean_m4_brief.md`, `lean_next_report.md`, and the original P31/Beckner briefs. Loaded the required number-theory research skill. No subagents or commits. Only this designated report will be edited among research Markdown files.
