+# Lean M4 report — 2026-10-19
+
+Status: whole-plane large-time limit and initial-time Fatou passage for bounded continuous compact data checked in the persistent Lean diagnostic session. Ordinary module build running; final whole-project build and file-based axiom audit still pending. Read `CLAUDE.md`, `lean_m4_brief.md`, `lean_next_report.md`, and the original P31/Beckner briefs. Loaded the required number-theory research skill. No subagents or commits. Only this designated report will be edited among research Markdown files.
